his legacy is intact...

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:15.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
despite the fact
that he came and did your show

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:18.284 size:88% position:44% line:92%
How was that experience?

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:19.419 line:92%
-It was fun, but I would -

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
I beg to differ
about his legacy being intac

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.491 size:75% position:38%
because now everyone
sees the true color.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
We've pulled away the veil
Obama is a Knicks hater! Okay?

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people
did not know that.

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:31.197
The White House hid that
from the American public.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:34.134
But now it's been revealed
This is the true scandal.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. Obama --
-It was wonderful.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was the time of our lives
interviewing him, man.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, no.
-He's the coolest person ever.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was wild.
-He talked both about the fact

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:44.677
Desus, that you don't have kids.
He complimented you, Mero,

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
