that you're raising four.

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:50.517
Were you surprised how much he
knew about your personal lives

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:53.586
-No, because he said --
he said -- He was like --

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like,
"You know, I watch your show."

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-But you have to remember --

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:58.925 line:92%
-Like, in a weird way though

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, in a weird,
like, you know, like,

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I saw that joke you made
about my jeans" way.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.231
-Yeah, but it was also --
-And we were just like --

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was also weird
because it's just like --

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Oh, wow!
He knows I don't have kids."

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then it's just like,
"Wait a minute. This guy was

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:12.605 size:78% position:39%
