00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:25.718
And I'm like, "Uh..."
-"Uh, Sir -- I don't know, sir."

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:30.657
"Uh, uh, it was 480p.
Uh, I don't know. I'm not sure."

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:34.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You had to --One of you had t
ask -- I think it was Mero

