00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:42.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, you know,
I didn't want to go make -

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, make anything --
hold anything up.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.939
So I was just like, "Oh,
I can make it through this

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:49.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm a 37-year-old man!
I can hold my pee for an hour.

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:51.978
You know? And I could not.
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I had to get up
